# AfroHR Hub — web environment
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC (safe to expose to the browser). The app authenticates
# users via Supabase Auth and reads data as the signed-in user, so RLS in the
# database enforces tenant isolation and confidentiality — no service-role key
# lives in the app. If these are unset, the app falls back to the in-repo mock
# data + the dev "View as" persona switcher (no login required).

